                                "sense_id": "e3c4c885-66a2-33e8-ba48-6b96fddd6866",
                                "text": "Or comets from their ſtream of blazing hair / Shake the blue peſtilence, and adverſe ſvvay / Of refluous battle, o'er ſome high vic'd land"
